{"repositoryId":1370231895,"availability":"available","full":"somehippie/small-tech-llc","name":"small-tech-llc","description":"Website for Small Tech LLC: A&R, AI training, personal finance and creative direction.","category":"Design","language":"CSS","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-14T16:35:45Z","updated":"2026-10-17T16:09:29Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://somehippie.github.io/small-tech-llc/","topics":["github-pages","html","personal-website","static-site","web-design"],"demo":"https://somehippie.github.io/small-tech-llc/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T22:41:05.339Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T22:41:05.339Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T22:41:05.339Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T22:41:05.339Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The website for Small Tech LLC, a one-person practice spanning A&R, AI training, personal finance and creative direction.","A single-page static site built on the \"st\" flavor of Paolo Bonaccorsi's design system. The character comes from a mixing desk: a grey faceplate, colour-coded channel knobs, engraved labels. One typeface, Archivo, does all the work, and its width axis is the voice: expanded for headlines, condensed for labels and buttons. Pine is the only accent.","The four practices sit in a ChannelStrip, laid out like channels on a desk, one soloed at a time. Each practice keeps its own channel colour. The solo bar sliding in when you pick a channel is the only motion on the page."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/somehippie/small-tech-llc/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c9ba7aaa6d204098f8610a12da5d12f997aa20ea050df560222306965a023909","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T22:41:05.414Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T22:41:05.414Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The website for Small Tech LLC, a one-person practice spanning A&R, AI training, personal finance and creative directi